This is an independent PyMOL plugin inspired by Blender and Molecular Nodes.
It does not include or require Blender, Molecular Nodes, their assets, or their
source code. The names identify the appearance reference, not an affiliation.

The command interface and documentation structure follow these MIT-licensed
projects by th2ch-g:
https://github.com/th2ch-g/chimerax_style_in_pymol
https://github.com/th2ch-g/molstar_style_in_pymol
https://github.com/th2ch-g/cuemol_style_in_pymol

Reference checks use a separately installed Blender and Molecular Nodes.
See docs/fidelity.md for versions, parameter provenance, and limitations.
